{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "998c944a2d1ec4e41b020e7546fb0e6168475e0dcef1e704cefef218b903e465", "ja": "新春の紅白", "zh": "新春红白", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "afbfddd8ec36896bd9b280a9d82306ca35b51806101c05f7d8cd997a3eb2569b", "ja": "新春公演を目前に控え、お揃いのお正月衣装\nでのライブを盛り上げようとテンションを高\nめる、アイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "新春公演即将开演，偶像们为了让身穿统一新年服装的演出更加热烈而兴致高涨的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5572452e4a8c9da606aca48181298e984537b5b0bf21478aad00116fff7b74f5", "ja": "（今年の新春公演は、765PRO ALLSTARSの\nステージで幕を上げる。みんな準備できたかな？）", "zh": "（今年的新春公演，将由765PRO ALLSTARS的舞台拉开帷幕。大家都准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "33b4f7f313f5f1a31aabc7989e0719fc1aa1190fbaca199a367d41b06d629e3c", "ja": "{$P$}、た、大変です～！", "zh": "{$P$}，不、不好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "abdc0a89b9766501d5009213968558da9d09e973c5e9ff9c7650c7882fef16dd", "ja": "おお、雪歩、着替えも終わったみたいだな。\nうん、よく似合ってるぞ！", "zh": "哦，雪步，看来也换好衣服了啊。\n嗯，很适合你哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0d12d5b303d7d1941770a4ecc7b5faa1d5d7da9b0f4c12d1dd71fd5b964afd45", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうですか……？　えへへっ♪\nこの振袖の衣装、すごくお気に入りで……。", "zh": "咦？是、是这样吗……？嘿嘿♪\n我特别喜欢这套振袖服装……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3c8e2ad454a1272d2701649d3db62162af6d56c799c84428f12bbfae02386aa0", "ja": "って、そうじゃなくって大変なんですぅ！\nな、なんだかみんなが揉めてて……。", "zh": "等等，不是这个，情况很糟糕啦！\n不、不知道为什么，大家好像吵起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a7d2ebd5b07e16fc3cde54f66a4b0f64e0b85555e4ddeb3acd96885b5b4c3b10", "ja": "えっ、正月早々……？\nとにかく、みんなのところに行こう！", "zh": "咦，大年初一就……？\n总之，先去大家那边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "9faa1fc2e02c15715a7e64c35357308308e037e3606bbf329fd58bfcf2634f73", "ja": "赤だーっ！！", "zh": "是红的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "9faa1fc2e02c15715a7e64c35357308308e037e3606bbf329fd58bfcf2634f73", "ja": "赤だーっ！！", "zh": "是红的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "9faa1fc2e02c15715a7e64c35357308308e037e3606bbf329fd58bfcf2634f73", "ja": "赤だーっ！！", "zh": "是红的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "4653a7a7deea357c3d064401cad271dfcb7379edfcdee3538e18a0829238c615", "ja": "白だーっ！！", "zh": "是白色的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "4653a7a7deea357c3d064401cad271dfcb7379edfcdee3538e18a0829238c615", "ja": "白だーっ！！", "zh": "是白色的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "7009209c112a3f7a3b784c3e334f41ee27fc2c0999a0e7c2fbf74f3db3a1f1bf", "ja": "なんたって、赤は熱く燃える気合いの色だからね！\n赤の勝ちだよ！", "zh": "毕竟，红色可是炽热燃烧的干劲之色嘛！\n红色赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "a238b0f6f18ee02c1db18a616d1b51c2de9813f5e19148867afa8e16176f848f", "ja": "あら、白は純潔を表す色よ！　アイドルには、\n白の方がふさわしいに決まってるじゃない！", "zh": "哎呀，白色可是代表纯洁的颜色哦！\n对偶像来说，明明绝对是白色更合适嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "6b05c30ee111ef357f4112c44c269fcfbe274f9a88a315fc1ae008e05cd0b45b", "ja": "赤はハイビスカスの色だぞっ！\n沖縄のハイビスカスは、すっごくきれいなんだからね！", "zh": "红色可是扶桑花的颜色哦！\n冲绳的扶桑花特别漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "ace023f89358dbfbd294b62b9c3908e9c9ba81ddee057e85394d73f9868e04b8", "ja": "真美は牛乳の白がいい！　いっぱい飲んだら、\nヘロモンムンムンになるんだかんね！", "zh": "真美喜欢牛奶一样的白色！多喝一点，就会荷尔蒙爆棚，知道了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "6e9e5a4a10d3a1114a594591d86f3d6e7572a2565bb86b1d626a40357f180425", "ja": "獅子舞も達磨も赤色でしょ？　お正月に、\nこんなにぴったりの色はないんじゃない？", "zh": "狮子舞和达摩都是红色的吧？新年里，应该没有比这更合适的颜色了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "89d5794e0ffda2c78fcbee9263ada343db5e2c5e784ad6e39469b49d6fd4108a", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……じゃ、じゃあ、\n白は紅白帽子の色だから……えーっと……。", "zh": "呜呜……那、那白色是红白帽的颜色，所以……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "41b0eacf5a8449cc4b00d234735481e3cb9279237d9f7ceca9ce1a0aa04f1c1f", "ja": "あーら、ぬかったわね、真美！\n紅白帽子には、赤色も入っているわよ！", "zh": "哎呀，大意了吧，真美！\n红白帽里面，可也是有红色的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "f28895669fa7e0009061fb53ff0db5041e9c19d8de3032121e759a78e7f7cf36", "ja": "うあうあ！　やっちまったよ～～っ！！\nいおりんに気をつけてって言われてたのにぃ～～！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊！搞砸了啦～～！！\n明明伊织都提醒过我要小心了～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "53fc1d14aee3022597edd654a1ce95a0a7ba1598b4ca3a89217c55f7f7429c61", "ja": "しっかりしなさいよね！　……あ、雪歩、ちょうど\n良かったわ。雪歩も白色のものをあげてちょうだい！", "zh": "给我振作一点啦！……啊，雪步，来得正好。雪步也请送一件白色的东西吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "da62874efdcd463ab3f35d9f865d4af51ec7ecdeb3d5cae502c6196e5dd402a3", "ja": "ええっ！？　き、急に言われても……。", "zh": "诶诶！？就、就算突然这么说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "db8fb3af816aa597248ad01369686767674c835519180bb4a9648f3fdaeff08a", "ja": "ちょっと待った！\nみんなはなにを揉めているんだ？", "zh": "等一下！\n你们是在争论什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "bc29b3b6933584098d171d1daf0796ccd071ad2d821ba80ee1b5a610b77fe27a", "ja": "揉めてる……？　自分達、ライブの前に\nテンションを上げてただけだぞ？", "zh": "吵起来……？我们只是在演唱会开始前提升气氛而已啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "d7d066afe5e03154887afe4880a321fb03f6f524a45288f8da08589e5557be26", "ja": "ほら、今日のライブの開幕に向かって、ですよ！", "zh": "你看，这是在为今天的演唱会开场造势嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4ac48051655b76de6d787603be3118d578d690cd6c9d0b842140583d366bb8ad", "ja": "開幕……？\nあ、なるほど。そういうことか。", "zh": "开幕……？\n啊，原来如此。是这么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "d0ca29821533fff46acb8baa1c79def68da5e6865f935fb4287fe05b0d4a69c4", "ja": "今日はみんなを全力で応援する曲で始まりますからね。\n私達の気持ちも、今から高めておかないと！", "zh": "今天要以一首全力为大家加油的歌曲拉开序幕。\n所以，我们的情绪也得从现在开始调动起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "e368fb543cc0cd3facb692a1366005aea60e36799d33c870dea32cec2ab887c5", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達を、\nドッカンドッカン盛り上げちゃうかんね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪　看真美把大哥哥大姐姐们的气氛\n彻底炒到最火爆吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "6e05cd6f16d8299f9277f6de45a3a7997bea66e47ee3ff71fe884a49eaaa1923", "ja": "みんな、お正月でボケボケしてるに決まってるもの。\nこの伊織ちゃんが目を覚まさせてあげなきゃね♪", "zh": "大家肯定还在过年的懒散状态里呢。得由本伊织把大家叫醒才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0504f54bbeac07927bbe65c8c1569a42bfcc3baf4f0aedf77ce3689cace96fef", "ja": "よかった、揉めてたんじゃなかったんだね。\n……うん、私も盛り上げられるように、頑張りますぅ！", "zh": "太好了，原来不是在争执啊。\n……嗯，我也会努力调动起气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d68cb8cb52cec8b6dfa9980af7d41b89b286c65554ff577fb99eee39f1e49a8c", "ja": "よし。その高めた気持ちを、思いっきりファンの\nみんなにぶつけよう。今年の最初の曲……。", "zh": "好。就把这份高涨的情绪，毫无保留地\n倾注给所有的粉丝吧。今年的第一首歌……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_408_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_408_cc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "33ab5dc6d27064a753fbf591964e389563304c08888aa92ea6af3e64c0954704", "ja": "『紅白応援V』で！", "zh": "就用《红白应援V》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
